            </calendarDesc>
            <particDesc>
                <p>An olive document in which the crop yields are re-evaluated after an earthquake in the year 755 CE.</p>
                <p>The document contains a list of olive trees and their crop yields, and seems to be a loan contract after said earthquake.</p>
                <p>The document is sealed by <persName ref="people:Tab015">Windādōhrmazd</persName>, <persName ref="people:Tab016">Windādyazd</persName>, <persName ref="people:Tab017">Wanandpanāh</persName>, and <persName ref="people:Tab018">Yazdfarrox</persName>. A person called <persName ref="people:Tab019">Farrox-Xusrōyān</persName> is also mentioned.</p>
                <p>The date of the transaction is Day Rašn, month Day, year 103 PY.</p>
            </particDesc>
            <settingDesc>
                <p><placeName>*Haspīn-Raz</placeName></p>
            </settingDesc>
            <creation>
                <date when="0103-10-18" calendar="#Pahlavi">Day Rašn, Month Day, 103 PY</date>
                <date when="0755-03-09" calendar="#Julian">9 March 755 CE</date>
            </creation>
        </profileDesc>
